## Model flow

Use the lightest sufficient path. Handle trivial edits, Q&A, and exploration directly. Delegate only when independent execution or review materially improves the result.

- The main model owns scope, contracts, synthesis, validation, and final acceptance.
- Keep one writer per file or isolated worktree.
- After focused behavioral validation, run `$local-review`.
- Pass compact artifacts such as briefs, diffs, file lists, and validation evidence—not full transcripts.
